/T (To collect, store, and visualize the metrics generated within the network topology, a set of monitoring tools was used. These tools work together to provide real-time insights into both system performance and network activity, as well as to display results from AI scripts that detect anomalies and predict traffic. Three tools were used for this purpose: Grafana for vizualizantions, Prometheus and Pushgateway for scraping. All these are running on local host, each on a configurable port, but usually: 3000 - Grafana, 9090 - Prometheus and 9091 - Pushgateway.  This setup ensures that the tools are fully accessible without requiring an Internet connection. All of them are open-source and freely available for download from their official websites [Gra25; Pro25]. )
/E (To collect, store, and visualize the metrics generated within the network topology, a set of monitoring tools was used. These tools work together to provide real-time insights into both system performance and network activity, as well as to display results from AI scripts that detect anomalies and predict traffic. Three tools were used for this purpose: Grafana for vizualizantions, Prometheus and Pushgateway for scraping. All these are running on local host, each on a configurable port, but usually: 3000 - Grafana, 9090 - Prometheus and 9091 - Pushgateway.  This setup ensures that the tools are fully accessible without requiring an Internet connection. All of them are open-source and freely available for download from their official websites [Gra25; Pro25]. )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
