/T (The first job, named alpine_nodes_forwarded, collects system metrics from Docker containers running inside the GNS3 network. Prometheus accesses these containers through the router's IP address \(192.168.0.112\) using different ports \(9201-9204\). Each container runs its own Node Exporter service, and this service listens to a unique por, that collects system-level metrics such as CPU usage, memory usage, disk space, and network activity and then exponses it. These metrics help monitor the health and performance of each container. Besides this, Prometheus exposes many other metrics from both router and containers, including CPU usage, memory usage, the amount of incoming traffic, and the status of each network interface. )
/E (The first job, named alpine_nodes_forwarded, collects system metrics from Docker containers running inside the GNS3 network. Prometheus accesses these containers through the router's IP address \(192.168.0.112\) using different ports \(9201-9204\). Each container runs its own Node Exporter service, and this service listens to a unique por, that collects system-level metrics such as CPU usage, memory usage, disk space, and network activity and then exponses it. These metrics help monitor the health and performance of each container. Besides this, Prometheus exposes many other metrics from both router and containers, including CPU usage, memory usage, the amount of incoming traffic, and the status of each network interface. )
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
