/T (  To visualize data collected by Prometheus, we use Grafana, which turns complex metrics into clear, interactive graphs and dashboards, making it easier to monitor and analyze network performance in real time, capabilities that Prometheus does not offer. Grafana connects directly to Prometheus as a data source and regularly queries it for updated metrics. It organizes this data into customizable dashboards with various panels like graphs, charts, and tables. Users can interact with these dashboards to select a specific time frames, apply filters, or compare different metrics. This visual approach helps quickly identify trends, spikes, or anomalies in network and system performance. )
/E (  To visualize data collected by Prometheus, we use Grafana, which turns complex metrics into clear, interactive graphs and dashboards, making it easier to monitor and analyze network performance in real time, capabilities that Prometheus does not offer. Grafana connects directly to Prometheus as a data source and regularly queries it for updated metrics. It organizes this data into customizable dashboards with various panels like graphs, charts, and tables. Users can interact with these dashboards to select a specific time frames, apply filters, or compare different metrics. This visual approach helps quickly identify trends, spikes, or anomalies in network and system performance. )
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
