/T (Grafana supports many types of charts and graphs, such as line graphs, bar charts, gauges, and tables. These visual elements are very customizable, so users can change colors, labels, sizes, and even the way data is grouped or filtered. This flexibility makes it easy to build dashboards that fit exactly what the user needs, whether it's for system monitoring, traffic analysis, or performance trends. )
/E (Grafana supports many types of charts and graphs, such as line graphs, bar charts, gauges, and tables. These visual elements are very customizable, so users can change colors, labels, sizes, and even the way data is grouped or filtered. This flexibility makes it easy to build dashboards that fit exactly what the user needs, whether it's for system monitoring, traffic analysis, or performance trends. )
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [8]
