/P 440 0 R
/T (  script, anomaly_detector.py, that detects unusual patterns in the data using Isolation Forest - a widely recognized method for anomaly detection in network traffic [Xia18]. After that, the script waits for 60 seconds using a fake ping command to the local address 127.0.0.1, which acts as a delay. This address is used because it always responds instantly, ensuring a reliable pause without depending on an external network connection. Once the waiting time is over, the script shows another message and runs the second Python file, traffic_predictor.py, which predicts future network traffic using an LSTM model [Zha22], [Gre17], [Cal22]. It waits another 60 seconds before going back to the beginning of the loop and repeating the same steps again. )
/E (  script, anomaly_detector.py, that detects unusual patterns in the data using Isolation Forest - a widely recognized method for anomaly detection in network traffic [Xia18]. After that, the script waits for 60 seconds using a fake ping command to the local address 127.0.0.1, which acts as a delay. This address is used because it always responds instantly, ensuring a reliable pause without depending on an external network connection. Once the waiting time is over, the script shows another message and runs the second Python file, traffic_predictor.py, which predicts future network traffic using an LSTM model [Zha22], [Gre17], [Cal22]. It waits another 60 seconds before going back to the beginning of the loop and repeating the same steps again. )
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
