/T (The JSON response from Prometheus is parsed, and the function checks if data is available for the metric. If no data is found, an empty panda DataFrame is created for that metric with timestamp and metric columns. Otherwise, the time series data \(values\) is extracted and converted into a pandas DataFrame \(df\), with timestamps converted from Unix time to readable datetime format, and metric values cast to floats so they can be used in mathematical operations. )
/E (The JSON response from Prometheus is parsed, and the function checks if data is available for the metric. If no data is found, an empty panda DataFrame is created for that metric with timestamp and metric columns. Otherwise, the time series data \(values\) is extracted and converted into a pandas DataFrame \(df\), with timestamps converted from Unix time to readable datetime format, and metric values cast to floats so they can be used in mathematical operations. )
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [57]
>>
endobj
