/T (The script then extracts useful performance information: the last anomaly prediction is converted into a flag \(anomaly_flag\), where 1 means an anomaly was detected and 0 means normal. It also calculates the overall anomaly rate \(anomaly_rate\), and the average and maximum anomaly scores \(anomaly_score_mean and anomaly_score_max\). All these metrics are sent to Prometheus for monitoring and saved locally in a CSV file, similarly to the traffic prediction script [Xia18], [Liu23]. )
