/T (This chapter is focused on practical results obtained by testing three different scenarios. Each scenario is built on the previous one with increasing complexity and functionality. The first scenario presents a basic GNS3 topology without being monitored or AI capabilities. The second scenario adds monitoring system, and the last scenario integrates AI features for anomaly detection and traffic prediction. )
/E (This chapter is focused on practical results obtained by testing three different scenarios. Each scenario is built on the previous one with increasing complexity and functionality. The first scenario presents a basic GNS3 topology without being monitored or AI capabilities. The second scenario adds monitoring system, and the last scenario integrates AI features for anomaly detection and traffic prediction. )
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1704 0 obj
