/P 446 0 R
/T (The purpose of these experiments is to observe how the addition of monitoring tools and intelligent models can improve network visibility and control. Each scenario is analyzed using different types of metrics collected from the network, such as traffic volume, interface activity, system usage, and communication patterns. The results are presented using real examples and visualizations that show the motivation of moving from a simpler to a smarter system. )
/E (The purpose of these experiments is to observe how the addition of monitoring tools and intelligent models can improve network visibility and control. Each scenario is analyzed using different types of metrics collected from the network, such as traffic volume, interface activity, system usage, and communication patterns. The results are presented using real examples and visualizations that show the motivation of moving from a simpler to a smarter system. )
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [10]
>>
