/E (Another method used to generate traffic involves a special container called webterm, which simulates real user behavior by accessing websites. This container runs a lightweight GUI and uses TightVNC \(a remote desktop server\) to allow interaction with a browser. TightVNC allows to open and view websites from the container like a normal browser. )
