/E (a link becomes down, or an error occurs, there is no notification or log to show what happened. All checks must be done manually, using basic commands. Furthermore, no traffic patterns can be observed, so there is no way to tell if network usage increases or if unusual behavior appears. Issues like congestion or security risks cannot be detected in this form. )
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [12]
>>
