1858 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 452 0 R
/T (These flags were generated by the anomaly detection script and pushed to Prometheus every 60 seconds using Pushgateway. Because Prometheus collected data at regular intervals \(every 15 seconds\), the same anomaly flag was recorded multiple times between script executions. For example, if the script detected an anomaly, that 'True' value might be scraped and stored four times before the next update. This resulted in a short series of identical values in the data, even though the script only produced one result. )
/E (These flags were generated by the anomaly detection script and pushed to Prometheus every 60 seconds using Pushgateway. Because Prometheus collected data at regular intervals \(every 15 seconds\), the same anomaly flag was recorded multiple times between script executions. For example, if the script detected an anomaly, that 'True' value might be scraped and stored four times before the next update. This resulted in a short series of identical values in the data, even though the script only produced one result. )
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
