2041 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 457 0 R
/T (This paper is structured as follows: Section II presents the proposed intelligent network monitoring architecture, which integrates Prometheus and Grafana with AI-based modules for traffic prediction and anomaly detection. Section III describes the implementation details and the experimental setup in GNS3 emulator. The paper ends with conclusions and future work. )
