/Title (Support Vector Regression \(SVR\) is another method frequently applied to traffic forecasting. It can model non-linear relationships using kernel functions and has shown solid performance in short-term prediction tasks. However, it still requires careful manual feature selection and struggles with long-term dependencies [Lyp24].)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 5675 0 R
/Next 5681 0 R
>>
