/Title (Prometheus, because Prometheus collects data only when the process is active. This is where Pushgateway becomes helpful. Pushgateway allows these processes to send their data directly to  a place where Prometheus can later pick it up. It acts like a temporary storage space for metrics. In this thesis, Pushgateway is used for collecting information from scripts or short-running tasks that are part of network testing. These scripts can push metrics such as packet delay or number of connections directly to Pushgateway. Prometheus will then access these values when it performs its regular data collection. This method ensures that even fast processes that finish quickly can still be included in the monitoring system [Pro25].)
/Dest [43 0 R /Fit]
