/Title (3.8 SNMP and Node Exporter for Scrape Metrics  Prometheus relies on exporters to collect metrics from external systems. Two common types of exporters used in monitoring infrastructure components are SNMP Exporter and Node Exporter. Both act as bridges between Prometheus and the devices or systems being monitored, exposing structured metrics in a format that Prometheus can scrape over HTTP.)
