/Title (The traffic prediction script \(traffic_predictor.py\) uses network data collected from the Cisco router running inside the GNS3 virtual topology [Fon18; GNS25] to predict the next value of incoming network traffic. The data is obtained with the function previously explained \(fetch_multiple_metrics\), which fetches several SNMP metrics as input features for the prediction model: incoming octets \(ifHCInOctets\), outgoing octets \(ifHCOutOctets\), input errors \(ifInErrors\), output errors \(ifOutErrors\), input discards \(ifInDiscards\), and output discards \(ifOutDiscards\) [OID25].)
/Dest [57 0 R /Fit]
