/Title (The second job, pushgateway, targets the local Pushgateway service running on localhost:9091. Pushgateway is used to collect and temporarily store data that is manually sent by AI scripts used for traffic prediction and anomaly detection. Since these scripts do not run all the time and cannot be scrapped regularly like containers or routers, they push their results directly  to Pushgateway every 60 seconds. Prometheus then picks up this data the next time it scrapes Pushgateway. This way, important metrics generated by AI models are not lost and can still be included in the monitoring dashboard. Pushgateway can be installed from the official Prometheus website [Pro25])
/Dest [51 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 5955 0 R
/Next 5959 0 R
>>
endobj
